{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00919","headline":"横吹曲辞 陇头水 · 王建","name":"横吹曲辞 陇头水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陇水何年陇头别，不在山中亦呜咽。\n征人塞耳马不行，未到陇头闻水声。\n谓是西流入蒲海，还闻北海绕龙城。\n陇东陇西多屈曲，野麋饮水长簇簇。\n胡兵夜回水傍住，忆着来时磨劒处。\n向前无井复无泉，放马回看陇头树。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00919.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00919","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}